        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Union Hall, Pearse Street, Gorey\n\nIdeally located in the heart of Gorey Town Centre, Union Hall is an attractive three-bedroom townhouse offering spacious and versatile accommodation, excellent convenience and a range of appealing features. This impressive building has a distinctive traditional stone exterior, with natural stonework complemented by attractive red brick detailing around the windows, doors and corners.\n\nRecently repainted throughout and benefiting from new carpeting, the property is presented in excellent condition and is ready for immediate occupation. The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, guest WC, a well-appointed kitchen/dining room and a comfortable living room at ground floor level. Upstairs there are three generous double bedrooms, each benefiting from its own en-suite bathroom, providing an excellent level of privacy and convenience. To the rear/side of the property is a separate office, ideal for those working from home or requiring additional workspace, together with a bathroom. The property also benefits from off-street parking, a particularly valuable feature given its town-centre location.\n\nUnion Hall is ideally positioned within easy walking distance of Gorey?s excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and local amenities, while also providing easy access to the town?s transport links.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented three-bedroom town-centre property with the added benefit of three en-suite bedrooms, a separate home office and off-street parking. This spacious well laid out accommodation briefly consists of entrance hallway, livingroom, kitchen/diningroom, guest wc, 3 double bedrooms all ensuite and an office with a bathroom.\n\n\nServices \nMains"
      },
